WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Client adoption requires
funded foundations.

00:00:02.729 --> 00:00:06.960
Business outcomes and reviewer
capacity sit alongside infrastructure,

00:00:07.016 --> 00:00:10.320
pipelines, test data
and application testability.

00:00:10.432 --> 00:00:15.600
Supported frameworks, approved AI access
and retained run evidence complete

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:19.680
the operating picture. Assess these
requirements for the selected workflow.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.640
Unknown evidence remains open. A pilot
can progress when its own prerequisites

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:29.200
are accepted, with accountable owners
and funding for the capability gaps.
